When you kill a foe you place small explosives with shrapnels inside its body, making it explode in radius 5.

Any foes hit will bleed for [15, 20, 24, 28, 31 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] damage per turn for 6 turns. The shrapnels also damage the vocal cords (or related organ), silencing them for [0, 1, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] turns.

''Use the finest of wartech now: shrapnels. For blood and mayhem!''
